      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacksonville%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "State Street, the original main road, cut through Jacksonville’s square and linked Springfield to the Illinois River.",
